      {
        "text": "J1, J2 and J3 each carry 1 GND, 2 3V3, 3 SDA, 4 SCL to the J1 of one bank sheet: J1 to bank A (sheet 2), J2 to bank B (sheet 3), J3 to bank C (sheet 4). No I2C pull-ups are drawn. This assumes a module on the bus already has SDA and SCL pull-up resistors: check the OLED (DS3) and the CJMCU-2317 boards. If none has them, add one 4.7 kohm resistor from SDA and one from SCL to 3V3, once for the whole bus.",
